activate API
API -> API: 3: Validate access session, role and input
alt Valid request
API -> Service: 4: Ask a guided verification question
activate Service
Service -> Table: 5: Read applicable question/template context
activate Table
Table --> Service: 6: Current verification template
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 7: Lock claim; actual Finder, active room, photo gate and request\nreplay
alt Business rules satisfied
Service -> Service: 8: Validate safe prompt and template version
Service -> Table: 9: INSERT approved prompt without expected-answer hash
activate Table
Table --> Service: 10: Question ID
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 11: Assign question to claim; add private question message and audit
Service -> Service: 12: Commit and return current verification detail
Service --> API: 13: Question and updated progress
API --> Page: 14: HTTP 201: Question and updated progress
Page --> Actor: 15: Show authorized result
else Missing or ineligible context
Service --> API: 8.1: Wrong actor, changed template or ended claim
API --> Page: 8.2: HTTP 404 or 409
Page --> Actor: 8.3: Display error; do not report success
end
deactivate Service
else Invalid input, missing session or insufficient role
API --> Page: 4.1: HTTP 422 / 401 / 403 (429 only if rate-limited)
Page --> Actor: 4.2: Show appropriate error; retain form/draft
end
deactivate API
deactivate Page

